# 📝 survival 

**Type:** org vs server 
**Location:** ASD bunkers or ground bunkers or jumptown  
**Frequency:** [Recurring / Custom / Org-run / One-time]

---

## 🎯 Objective
no objective just kill as many bounty hunters as possible and survive resist and escape 

---

## 🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Roles & Rules

### only one team 
- **Team Size:** no limit 
- **Respawns:** unlimited 
- **Weapons:** all 
- **Armor:** heavy 
- **Ships / Vehicles:** ground vehicules + one capital ship for respawn and resuply + after 60 min any vehicule is allowed to evade resist and escape 



### logistic team
- 3 players with no crime stat to resupply ground team with new vehicules and respawn

---

## ⚔️ Gameplay Example
- **Setup:** criminals will obtain cs 5 by any means and set up defensive position in an ASD bunker or ground location 
- **Flow:** survive as long as it takes after 60 min in the bunker head to spk to clear crimestat 
- **End Condition:** all goes to prison 

---

## 🏆 Win Conditions
- **Role / Team Victory:** managing to clear CS in SPK 
- **Optional Tiebreaker:** no tie victory or death in the mines of klesher 

---

## 🔑 Notes & Tips
- logistic team will provide transport to grim hex and from there to spk
